Package: vpntoris
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: __DEB_ARCH__
Depends: systemd, iproute2, ppp, zenity | kdialog | whiptail
Recommends: libsecret-tools
Maintainer: VPNToris Maintainers <noreply@vpntoris.local>
Description: Multi-profile split-route corporate VPN client
 VPNToris manages concurrent VPN sessions with profile-scoped CIDR routes.
 This package installs the localhost controller, privileged native helper,
 CLI and system tray client. Engines are bundled under /var/lib/vpntoris/engines
 when provided at package build time. A private AppIndicator shell extension
 is bundled for GNOME tray support.
